---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with RevX, report a problem or abuse, or delete your account."
>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:revxtheapp@gmail.com">revxtheapp@gmail.com</a> for help with your account,
    a bug, or a privacy request. Tell us the email on your account and what happened.
  </p>
  <h2>Report abuse</h2>
  <p>
    In the app, open the menu on a chat, profile, problem or Community post and choose Report or
    Block. You can also email us, and screenshots help. We aim to review reports within 24 hours.
  </p>
  <h2>Delete your account</h2>
  <p>
    In the app, go to Profile, then Account &amp; Security, then Delete account. This permanently
    deletes your data, as described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>In an emergency</h2>
  <p>If you are in danger, call 911. RevX cannot respond to emergencies.</p>
</LegalPage>
